  "solution": {
    "brief": "Map hexagonal grid curves onto a surface via UV domain remapping. Extracts control points from hex cells, remaps XY coordinates to 0-1 using global bounds, evaluates surface at remapped UVs, and rebuilds polylines on the surface. Key pattern: flatten before Bounds for global domain, preserve tree structure through Remap for per-curve grouping.",
